  button "Review the hold on {r.On}" => "مراجعة التجميد على {r.On}";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a description
  /// shown through SettingsPage.description
  description "A hold keeps everything about a person — or one case — from being erased or purged while a dispute, a claim or an audit needs it. A request to erase it waits, and the person is told only that it is kept for legal claims." => "يحمي التجميد كل ما يخص شخصًا، أو قضية واحدة، من المحو أو الحذف ما دام نزاع أو مطالبة أو تدقيق يحتاج إليه. ينتظر طلب المحو، ولا يُبلَّغ الشخص إلا بأن بياناته محفوظة لأغراض المطالبات القانونية.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a description
  /// shown through SettingsSection.description
  description "Kept as a record — who lifted each hold, when and why — then forgotten after the period the kit's own records are kept." => "تُحفظ كسجل، يبيّن من رفع كل تجميد ومتى ولماذا، ثم تُنسى بعد المدة التي تُحفظ فيها سجلات الأداة نفسها.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a hint under a field
  /// shown through Field.hint
  /// beside: "Their email address", "Why it must be kept", "Review by", "Cancel"
  hint "Never shown to the person." => "لا يُعرض على الشخص أبدًا.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~23 characters
  /// shown through Badge.label
  label "No second person" => "بلا شخص ثانٍ";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~31 characters
  /// shown through Badge.label
  label "Second person required" => "يتطلب شخصًا ثانيًا";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~27 characters
  /// shown through Field.label
  /// beside: "Matter", "Why it must be kept", "Review by", "Cancel"
  label "Their email address" => "عنوان بريده الإلكتروني";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · message
  /// shown through Alert.message
  message "Pick the date the hold is reviewed — a hold is never kept for ever unseen." => "اختر تاريخ مراجعة التجميد، فالتجميد لا يُبقى إلى الأبد دون مراجعة.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~37 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  /// beside: "Their email address", "Why it must be kept", "Review by", "Cancel"
  placeholder "Dispute with Acme AB, 2026" => "نزاع مع Acme AB، 2026";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~42 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  /// beside: "Their email address", "Matter", "Review by", "Cancel"
  placeholder "The complaint may go to court." => "قد تُرفع الشكوى إلى المحكمة.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~21 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  /// beside: "Matter", "Why it must be kept", "Review by", "Cancel"
  placeholder "ann@example.com" => "ann@example.com";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Everything held about this person is kept — not erased on request, not purged — until the hold is lifted." => "يُحتفظ بكل ما يخص هذا الشخص، فلا يُمحى عند الطلب ولا يُحذف، حتى يُرفع التجميد.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "It stays in force; somebody looks at it again on the date you pick." => "يبقى ساريًا؛ وسيعيد أحدهم النظر فيه في التاريخ الذي تختاره.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {ToString} = r.LiftedAt.Value.ToString(…) (DateTime)
  text " on {ToString}" => " في {ToString}";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {ToLower} = ….ToLower(…) (string)
  /// shown through done
  text "Holding everything about {ToLower}. Nothing about them is erased or purged until the hold is lifted." => "يُحتفظ بكل ما يخص {ToLower}. لن يُمحى أو يُحذف أي شيء عنه حتى يُرفع التجميد.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {ToString} = nextReview.Value.ToString(…) (DateOnly)
  /// shown through done
  text "Kept, and reviewed again on {ToString}." => "تم الإبقاء عليه، وستتم مراجعته مجددًا في {ToString}.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {r.LiftedBy} = r.LiftedBy (string), {value} = … (string), {r.LiftReason} = r.LiftReason (string)
  text "Lifted by {r.LiftedBy}{value}: “{r.LiftReason}”" => "رفعه {r.LiftedBy}{value}: «{r.LiftReason}»";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// shown through done
  text "Lifted. What waited on it runs now." => "تم الرفع. ما كان ينتظره يُنفَّذ الآن.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// shown through EmptyState.body
  text "Nothing is held now. When a dispute, a claim or an audit needs a person's data kept, place a hold here — or on a case from its own page." => "لا يوجد شيء مجمّد الآن. عندما يحتاج نزاع أو مطالبة أو تدقيق إلى الاحتفاظ ببيانات شخص، افرض تجميدًا هنا، أو على قضية من صفحتها.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {r.PlacedBy} = r.PlacedBy (string), {ToString} = r.PlacedAt.ToString(…) (DateTime), {ToString2} = r.ReviewBy.ToString(…) (DateTime)
  text "Placed by {r.PlacedBy} on {ToString} · review by {ToString2}" => "فرضه {r.PlacedBy} في {ToString} · المراجعة بحلول {ToString2}";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// shown through done
  text "The lift waits for a second person to confirm it — the hold stays in force until then." => "ينتظر الرفع تأكيد شخص ثانٍ، ويبقى التجميد ساريًا حتى ذلك الحين.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// shown through done
  text "The lift was withdrawn — the hold stays in force." => "سُحب طلب الرفع، ويبقى التجميد ساريًا.";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {r.LiftRequestedBy} = r.LiftRequestedBy (string), {r.LiftReason} = r.LiftReason (string)
  text "{r.LiftRequestedBy} asked to lift it: “{r.LiftReason}”" => "طلب {r.LiftRequestedBy} رفعه: «{r.LiftReason}»";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a title
  /// shown through SettingsPage.title
  /// also in LegalHoldsSettings /settings/privacy/holds
  title "Legal holds" => "التجميد القانوني";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a title
  /// placeholders: {liftOn} = liftOn (string)
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Lift the hold on {liftOn}" => "رفع التجميد عن {liftOn}";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a title
  /// shown through SettingsSection.title
  title "Lifted" => "المرفوعة";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a title
  /// shown through SettingsSection.title
  /// beside: "Place a hold"
  title "Lifting a hold" => "رفع التجميد";
  /// LegalHoldsEditor · a title
